# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Cargo.lock is committed on this branch: CI runs every cargo command with
# --locked, so it tests the dependency set that is in the repository rather
# than whatever resolves on the day. Downstream crates ignore it either way.

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk


